  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "小李，你把我后备箱里的茅台拿上去，领导的暗示，你能听得懂吗？没有啊，哎被偷你干什么？赵总，茅台都被偷了，你为什么不让我说呀？不是，这职场上理会错，领导的意思是大忌。车里没有酒，赵总却让你送上去，说明他只在意结果，你又何必去纠结车里酒的去向和真实性呢？满足领导的需求最重要哦。赵总，您车里的东西呢？我不好乱翻，就自己准备了。四瓶两瓶留在您车里了。这两瓶拿上来您先用，赵总，咱们下次见啊。哎，好，哎，刘总你怎么走了呀，是不是嫌报价不满意啊？恭喜赵总拿下合同，小李，后续你来负责吧。哎，赵总，这这赵总这怎么回事儿？这个项目一直是大刘在负责，赵总突然把项目给我了。茶汤回湖是谈判的收尾动作，象征着交易达成。大刘连这个都不懂，赵总怎么敢把项目交给他呀？不能吧，人情世故是是门大问，你要学的呀，还多着呢。老婆赵，总把上次的酒钱转过来了，你看哎，你怎么收了呀？赵总转多了，你赶紧给他退回去。你自以为有原则的退还，只会让领导觉得麻烦，还不如大大方方收下呢。那我是不是得说点啥呀，你就说感谢领导大气，果然跟着领导有甜头，吃就这样就行了。当然不行啊，好吃的。赵总，请大家喝奶茶了啊，人人都有。我什么时候请大家喝奶茶了？奶茶钱，您不是跟着酒钱一块转给我了吗？哈哈哈，拜拜。小李周天来家里坐坐，尝尝你嫂子的手艺。嫂子，你可算出来了，我都快憋死了。哎，你拉我干什么？我也很急啊，憋死吧，不知道的还以为洗手间是什么好地方。哎呀，行了，你们坐我去做饭，老赵帮我处理一下鱼。老婆，我怎么看？赵总和嫂子有点不高兴，因为异性厕所十分钟效应，人家。赵总，老婆刚从卫生间出来，你就是再着急，你等十分钟再怎么可能是因为这个呀，你照做就行，嫂子，我来帮你。赵总，嫂子，那我走了，那我们也先走小李，留下接待王总的事情，咱们再碰一下，那得叫小张回来呀，不用你负责就行。好的，赵总，哎，老婆，你这个厕所十分钟效应还真有说法，这都是不成文的社交规矩。你呀多看看这本闲谈高手，假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，你就每天看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你也会变成一个会说话的人我当时听到这句话的时候，我的眼泪就出来了，他写的是别人夸你优秀你就回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友？你看很有味道，假如不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。哇，这真是太棒了。在这本书里边，有一句话我特别欣赏。他说有人嘲讽你眼睛小，高情商回答，万物皆有裂痕，那是光照进来的地方。哇，这真是太棒了，每一句都很有意思，随便翻对吧？哇，这句话太好了，他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，你就会比以前好多了。现在吃泡面敢放两根长了。我读到这段的时候，我觉得这个让我真是欲解心开啊，这本书就像是个社交宝典，把各种社交场景都变成了问题，加答案的形式。你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，这是我这几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。我觉得这书适合所有人，让你不管在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏。所以强烈推荐。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00001",
      "start_ms": 70,
      "end_ms": 470,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00002",
      "start_ms": 650,
      "end_ms": 2550,
      "text": "你把我后备箱里的茅台拿上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2770,
      "end_ms": 3630,
      "text": "领导的暗示，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3630,
      "end_ms": 4590,
      "text": "你能听得懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5990,
      "end_ms": 6630,
      "text": "没有啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00006",
      "start_ms": 6630,
      "end_ms": 8010,
      "text": "哎被偷你干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00007",
      "start_ms": 8090,
      "end_ms": 8370,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00008",
      "start_ms": 8370,
      "end_ms": 9090,
      "text": "茅台都被偷了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00009",
      "start_ms": 9090,
      "end_ms": 10170,
      "text": "你为什么不让我说呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00010",
      "start_ms": 10190,
      "end_ms": 10450,
      "text": "不是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00011",
      "start_ms": 10450,
      "end_ms": 11850,
      "text": "这职场上理会错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00012",
      "start_ms": 11850,
      "end_ms": 12910,
      "text": "领导的意思是大忌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00013",
      "start_ms": 13030,
      "end_ms": 13750,
      "text": "车里没有酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00014",
      "start_ms": 13750,
      "end_ms": 14710,
      "text": "赵总却让你送上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00015",
      "start_ms": 14710,
      "end_ms": 15850,
      "text": "说明他只在意结果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00016",
      "start_ms": 15850,
      "end_ms": 18290,
      "text": "你又何必去纠结车里酒的去向和真实性呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00017",
      "start_ms": 18390,
      "end_ms": 20030,
      "text": "满足领导的需求最重要哦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00018",
      "start_ms": 22070,
      "end_ms": 22490,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00019",
      "start_ms": 22730,
      "end_ms": 23690,
      "text": "您车里的东西呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00020",
      "start_ms": 23690,
      "end_ms": 24410,
      "text": "我不好乱翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00021",
      "start_ms": 24610,
      "end_ms": 25330,
      "text": "就自己准备了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00022",
      "start_ms": 25330,
      "end_ms": 27130,
      "text": "四瓶两瓶留在您车里了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00023",
      "start_ms": 27130,
      "end_ms": 29155,
      "text": "这两瓶拿上来您先用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00024",
      "start_ms": 33390,
      "end_ms": 33770,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00025",
      "start_ms": 33890,
      "end_ms": 34670,
      "text": "咱们下次见啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00026",
      "start_ms": 34670,
      "end_ms": 34770,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00027",
      "start_ms": 34770,
      "end_ms": 35010,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00028",
      "start_ms": 35210,
      "end_ms": 35450,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00029",
      "start_ms": 35450,
      "end_ms": 36490,
      "text": "刘总你怎么走了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00030",
      "start_ms": 36610,
      "end_ms": 38115,
      "text": "是不是嫌报价不满意啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00031",
      "start_ms": 40410,
      "end_ms": 41670,
      "text": "恭喜赵总拿下合同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00032",
      "start_ms": 41710,
      "end_ms": 42090,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00033",
      "start_ms": 42510,
      "end_ms": 43530,
      "text": "后续你来负责吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00034",
      "start_ms": 44010,
      "end_ms": 44250,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00035",
      "start_ms": 44330,
      "end_ms": 44730,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00036",
      "start_ms": 44890,
      "end_ms": 47390,
      "text": "这这赵总这怎么回事儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00037",
      "start_ms": 47390,
      "end_ms": 49130,
      "text": "这个项目一直是大刘在负责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00038",
      "start_ms": 49130,
      "end_ms": 50630,
      "text": "赵总突然把项目给我了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00039",
      "start_ms": 50630,
      "end_ms": 52670,
      "text": "茶汤回湖是谈判的收尾动作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00040",
      "start_ms": 52670,
      "end_ms": 53850,
      "text": "象征着交易达成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00041",
      "start_ms": 53850,
      "end_ms": 54870,
      "text": "大刘连这个都不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00042",
      "start_ms": 54870,
      "end_ms": 56550,
      "text": "赵总怎么敢把项目交给他呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00043",
      "start_ms": 56550,
      "end_ms": 57570,
      "text": "不能吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00044",
      "start_ms": 57570,
      "end_ms": 59250,
      "text": "人情世故是是门大问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00045",
      "start_ms": 59390,
      "end_ms": 60325,
      "text": "你要学的呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00046",
      "start_ms": 60500,
      "end_ms": 61125,
      "text": "还多着呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00047",
      "start_ms": 61360,
      "end_ms": 62420,
      "text": "老婆赵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00048",
      "start_ms": 62420,
      "end_ms": 63620,
      "text": "总把上次的酒钱转过来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00049",
      "start_ms": 63620,
      "end_ms": 65150,
      "text": "你看哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00050",
      "start_ms": 65150,
      "end_ms": 66090,
      "text": "你怎么收了呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00051",
      "start_ms": 66090,
      "end_ms": 66690,
      "text": "赵总转多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00052",
      "start_ms": 66690,
      "end_ms": 67510,
      "text": "你赶紧给他退回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00053",
      "start_ms": 67510,
      "end_ms": 68930,
      "text": "你自以为有原则的退还，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00054",
      "start_ms": 68950,
      "end_ms": 70110,
      "text": "只会让领导觉得麻烦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00055",
      "start_ms": 70170,
      "end_ms": 71575,
      "text": "还不如大大方方收下呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00056",
      "start_ms": 72120,
      "end_ms": 73715,
      "text": "那我是不是得说点啥呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00057",
      "start_ms": 74060,
      "end_ms": 75945,
      "text": "你就说感谢领导大气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00058",
      "start_ms": 76290,
      "end_ms": 77750,
      "text": "果然跟着领导有甜头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00059",
      "start_ms": 77750,
      "end_ms": 79220,
      "text": "吃就这样就行了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00060",
      "start_ms": 79340,
      "end_ms": 80205,
      "text": "当然不行啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00061",
      "start_ms": 81070,
      "end_ms": 81555,
      "text": "好吃的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00062",
      "start_ms": 81770,
      "end_ms": 82150,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00063",
      "start_ms": 82150,
      "end_ms": 83410,
      "text": "请大家喝奶茶了啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00064",
      "start_ms": 83490,
      "end_ms": 84345,
      "text": "人人都有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00065",
      "start_ms": 86770,
      "end_ms": 88570,
      "text": "我什么时候请大家喝奶茶了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00066",
      "start_ms": 88650,
      "end_ms": 89290,
      "text": "奶茶钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00067",
      "start_ms": 89590,
      "end_ms": 91615,
      "text": "您不是跟着酒钱一块转给我了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00068",
      "start_ms": 92290,
      "end_ms": 92725,
      "text": "哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00069",
      "start_ms": 92910,
      "end_ms": 93135,
      "text": "拜拜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00070",
      "start_ms": 94010,
      "end_ms": 96740,
      "text": "小李周天来家里坐坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00071",
      "start_ms": 97060,
      "end_ms": 98585,
      "text": "尝尝你嫂子的手艺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00072",
      "start_ms": 102370,
      "end_ms": 102830,
      "text": "嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00073",
      "start_ms": 102830,
      "end_ms": 103710,
      "text": "你可算出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00074",
      "start_ms": 103710,
      "end_ms": 104805,
      "text": "我都快憋死了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00075",
      "start_ms": 105920,
      "end_ms": 106165,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00076",
      "start_ms": 106740,
      "end_ms": 107880,
      "text": "你拉我干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00077",
      "start_ms": 107900,
      "end_ms": 109000,
      "text": "我也很急啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00078",
      "start_ms": 109040,
      "end_ms": 109935,
      "text": "憋死吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00079",
      "start_ms": 110500,
      "end_ms": 113720,
      "text": "不知道的还以为洗手间是什么好地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00080",
      "start_ms": 113860,
      "end_ms": 114300,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00081",
      "start_ms": 114340,
      "end_ms": 114865,
      "text": "行了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00082",
      "start_ms": 115360,
      "end_ms": 116365,
      "text": "你们坐我去做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00083",
      "start_ms": 116780,
      "end_ms": 118055,
      "text": "老赵帮我处理一下鱼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00084",
      "start_ms": 118800,
      "end_ms": 119255,
      "text": "老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00085",
      "start_ms": 119620,
      "end_ms": 120200,
      "text": "我怎么看？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00086",
      "start_ms": 120580,
      "end_ms": 122095,
      "text": "赵总和嫂子有点不高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00087",
      "start_ms": 122590,
      "end_ms": 124525,
      "text": "因为异性厕所十分钟效应，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00088",
      "start_ms": 124760,
      "end_ms": 125000,
      "text": "人家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00089",
      "start_ms": 125000,
      "end_ms": 125300,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00090",
      "start_ms": 125300,
      "end_ms": 126640,
      "text": "老婆刚从卫生间出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00091",
      "start_ms": 126700,
      "end_ms": 127460,
      "text": "你就是再着急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00092",
      "start_ms": 127460,
      "end_ms": 130135,
      "text": "你等十分钟再怎么可能是因为这个呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00093",
      "start_ms": 130770,
      "end_ms": 131895,
      "text": "你照做就行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00094",
      "start_ms": 134070,
      "end_ms": 134550,
      "text": "嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00095",
      "start_ms": 134650,
      "end_ms": 135350,
      "text": "我来帮你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00096",
      "start_ms": 135790,
      "end_ms": 136190,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00097",
      "start_ms": 136230,
      "end_ms": 136675,
      "text": "嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00098",
      "start_ms": 136910,
      "end_ms": 137605,
      "text": "那我走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00099",
      "start_ms": 137930,
      "end_ms": 142660,
      "text": "那我们也先走小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00100",
      "start_ms": 142660,
      "end_ms": 144525,
      "text": "留下接待王总的事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00101",
      "start_ms": 144740,
      "end_ms": 145540,
      "text": "咱们再碰一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00102",
      "start_ms": 145620,
      "end_ms": 147115,
      "text": "那得叫小张回来呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00103",
      "start_ms": 150090,
      "end_ms": 152005,
      "text": "不用你负责就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00104",
      "start_ms": 152970,
      "end_ms": 153370,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00105",
      "start_ms": 153370,
      "end_ms": 153730,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00106",
      "start_ms": 153910,
      "end_ms": 154150,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00107",
      "start_ms": 154270,
      "end_ms": 154705,
      "text": "老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00108",
      "start_ms": 155030,
      "end_ms": 157405,
      "text": "你这个厕所十分钟效应还真有说法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00109",
      "start_ms": 157630,
      "end_ms": 159315,
      "text": "这都是不成文的社交规矩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00110",
      "start_ms": 159690,
      "end_ms": 161730,
      "text": "你呀多看看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00111",
      "start_ms": 161970,
      "end_ms": 163090,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00112",
      "start_ms": 163130,
      "end_ms": 163870,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00113",
      "start_ms": 163950,
      "end_ms": 164810,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00114",
      "start_ms": 165150,
      "end_ms": 166425,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00115",
      "start_ms": 166730,
      "end_ms": 167890,
      "text": "你就每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00116",
      "start_ms": 168110,
      "end_ms": 169435,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00117",
      "start_ms": 169750,
      "end_ms": 173490,
      "text": "你也会变成一个会说话的人我当时听到这句话的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00118",
      "start_ms": 173650,
      "end_ms": 174930,
      "text": "我的眼泪就出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00119",
      "start_ms": 174930,
      "end_ms": 177310,
      "text": "他写的是别人夸你优秀你就回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00120",
      "start_ms": 177590,
      "end_ms": 178690,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00121",
      "start_ms": 178850,
      "end_ms": 180190,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00122",
      "start_ms": 180270,
      "end_ms": 181310,
      "text": "你看很有味道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00123",
      "start_ms": 181350,
      "end_ms": 182390,
      "text": "假如不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00124",
      "start_ms": 182530,
      "end_ms": 183290,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00125",
      "start_ms": 183430,
      "end_ms": 184310,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00126",
      "start_ms": 184550,
      "end_ms": 185690,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00127",
      "start_ms": 185870,
      "end_ms": 187110,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00128",
      "start_ms": 187270,
      "end_ms": 188610,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00129",
      "start_ms": 188670,
      "end_ms": 191190,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00130",
      "start_ms": 191490,
      "end_ms": 191730,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00131",
      "start_ms": 191910,
      "end_ms": 192985,
      "text": "这真是太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00132",
      "start_ms": 193180,
      "end_ms": 194000,
      "text": "在这本书里边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00133",
      "start_ms": 194000,
      "end_ms": 195360,
      "text": "有一句话我特别欣赏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00134",
      "start_ms": 195620,
      "end_ms": 197280,
      "text": "他说有人嘲讽你眼睛小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00135",
      "start_ms": 197540,
      "end_ms": 198580,
      "text": "高情商回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00136",
      "start_ms": 198760,
      "end_ms": 199900,
      "text": "万物皆有裂痕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00137",
      "start_ms": 200120,
      "end_ms": 201560,
      "text": "那是光照进来的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00138",
      "start_ms": 201780,
      "end_ms": 202020,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00139",
      "start_ms": 202100,
      "end_ms": 203115,
      "text": "这真是太棒了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00140",
      "start_ms": 203360,
      "end_ms": 204560,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00141",
      "start_ms": 204740,
      "end_ms": 205740,
      "text": "随便翻对吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00142",
      "start_ms": 205860,
      "end_ms": 206100,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00143",
      "start_ms": 206200,
      "end_ms": 207245,
      "text": "这句话太好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00144",
      "start_ms": 207590,
      "end_ms": 209750,
      "text": "他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00145",
      "start_ms": 209950,
      "end_ms": 211405,
      "text": "你就会比以前好多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00146",
      "start_ms": 211710,
      "end_ms": 213650,
      "text": "现在吃泡面敢放两根长了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00147",
      "start_ms": 213830,
      "end_ms": 215070,
      "text": "我读到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00148",
      "start_ms": 215170,
      "end_ms": 217330,
      "text": "我觉得这个让我真是欲解心开啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00149",
      "start_ms": 217430,
      "end_ms": 219315,
      "text": "这本书就像是个社交宝典，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00150",
      "start_ms": 219630,
      "end_ms": 221910,
      "text": "把各种社交场景都变成了问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00151",
      "start_ms": 221910,
      "end_ms": 222995,
      "text": "加答案的形式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00152",
      "start_ms": 223310,
      "end_ms": 225925,
      "text": "你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00153",
      "start_ms": 226300,
      "end_ms": 229700,
      "text": "就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00154",
      "start_ms": 229960,
      "end_ms": 232825,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00155",
      "start_ms": 233120,
      "end_ms": 234400,
      "text": "你就放心拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00156",
      "start_ms": 234620,
      "end_ms": 236095,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00157",
      "start_ms": 236450,
      "end_ms": 239165,
      "text": "这是我这几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00158",
      "start_ms": 239560,
      "end_ms": 241180,
      "text": "我觉得这书适合所有人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00159",
      "start_ms": 241480,
      "end_ms": 244195,
      "text": "让你不管在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_325a2849484e6f15_s00160",
      "start_ms": 244540,
      "end_ms": 245475,
      "text": "所以强烈推荐。"
    }
  ],
